      "incident_updates": [
        {
          "id": "j08bwty5ww6j",
          "status": "identified",
          "body": "We have identified the cause of impaired service integrations, including WhatsApp, Facebook, Instagram, and Ads, since 4:05 PM UTC+02:00 due to disruptions to Meta services. We are monitoring Meta's recovery closely and will confirm once all integrations are functioning normally. You can follow the issue here: https://metastatus.com/\n\nWe will be back with an update within 1 hour.\n\nThe information on this page reflects our understanding of the incident and impact at the time of the update.",
